/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-032/src/kafka/docs/kafka-connect/user-guide.md:183:  * MaskField \- Replace field with valid null value for the type (0, empty string, etc) or custom replacement (non-empty string or numeric value only)
