/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-trade/2da9385f-4fe4-506a-be3d-78153c549662/scratchpad/cat8/venvs/8-032/src/kafka/docs/streams/developer-guide/dsl-api.md:4397:  * The join is indirectly _key-based_ , i.e. with the join predicate `KeyValueMapper#apply(leftRecord.key, leftRecord.value) == rightRecord.key`.
